      "body": "I approve Phase 3 static-delivery policy evolution v1 for issue #62 at preapproval commit 9934d69e4025f6dd2032375bae7e92c300b66459, preapproval SHA-256 99837823dc003aaa516ff9842c38dbb1ccdad3e744195765f9f165baa070410f, audited base df3b54f9b2566e2550ea15a408c4900c74c70102, immutable Phase 2 issue #71 receipt commit fd38eddccb5dce6405df48a8f25c045e740efdca, and immutable Phase 3 issue #61 v4 receipt commit c5ae8de77cef991dd21f3b7956b2b2cb23ac2918. This authorizes only the complete exact before/after Git blob states for the 42 governed repository paths listed in that preapproval, including the pre-bound Issue #62 tests. It authorizes repository-only OpenTofu, workflow, validation, fixture, documentation, and evidence states; infrastructure apply remains unauthorized, and publication or data upload remains independently gated by Issue #64. Issue #74 managed rulesets, environments, OIDC, imports, drift scheduling, and exception-register resources remain required and deferred, and this approval does not claim that they exist. It does not modify or waive Issue #71 or Issue #61 P/D/A/R history and does not authorize Candidate-v7 or TAR inspection, copying, publication, upload, or use; Cloudflare resource, DNS, state, credential, GitHub environment, or secret creation, deletion, mutation, apply, publication, or upload; or deletion or mutation of any external resource.",
